  "details": "1. Open alxr (recognized as Oculus Touch) or PICO Virtual Reality. 2. Open VRChat. 3. Reset the Steam VR operation settings of VRChat to the default state. 4. Enter any world. 5. You will find that the input methods used to switch between different finger movements are different. At least two movements of each hand cannot be switched (Victory and Rock N Roll). 6. Enter“ https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_ad144359-8a81-423d-9eca-e824aacbd0ce ”This world. You will find that after pressing the trigger, Udon seems to have no response. If you delete the bones of the VR Controller in the input settings of SteamVR. The operation method of finger movements will be successfully restored. But you will find that in this' world ', the input of the' a 'key is invalid. Before the SteamVR Input 2.0 update, these issues did not exist.",
